# 📈 Zerodha Clone — MERN Stack Trading Platform

A full-stack **Zerodha-inspired trading platform** built using the MERN stack.

This project demonstrates a complete modern web application with authentication, stock watchlist, orders, holdings, positions, REST APIs, MongoDB, Docker containerization, Nginx reverse proxy, and AWS EC2 deployment.

> ⚠️ This is an educational/project implementation inspired by Zerodha. It is not affiliated with or operated by Zerodha.

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

🌐 **Live Application**

http://16.192.193.235/

### Application Routes

- Landing Page: `/`
- Dashboard: `/dashboard/`
- Backend Health: `/api/...`

> Current deployment uses an AWS EC2 public IP. Custom domain and HTTPS/SSL are planned next.

---

# ✨ Features

## 🔐 Authentication

- User Registration
- User Login
- JWT Authentication
- Protected API Routes
- Authentication Middleware
- `/api/auth/me`
- Password validation
- User-specific data access

## 📊 Trading Dashboard

- Watchlist
- Holdings
- Positions
- Orders
- Funds
- Profile
- Buy/Sell interface

## 📦 Orders

- Create BUY orders
- Create SELL orders
- Quantity handling
- Order status
- User-specific orders
- REST API integration

## 💼 Holdings

- Stock holdings
- Quantity
- Average price
- Current price
- Investment value
- Current value
- Profit/Loss

## 📈 Positions

- Position tracking
- BUY/SELL information
- Quantity
- Price information

## 👤 User Data

Authenticated users can access their own:

- Orders
- Holdings
- Positions
- Profile information

