# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend

- React.js
- React Router
- Context API
- JavaScript
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Axios / Fetch API
- Bootstrap / Tailwind CSS

## Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- REST API
- JWT
- Middleware
- Express Validator
- CORS

## Database

- MongoDB
- MongoDB Atlas
- Mongoose

## DevOps / Deployment

- Docker
- Docker Compose
- Nginx
- AWS EC2
- Ubuntu Linux
- Git
- GitHub

